@startuml
actor Player
participant ChapterDirector
participant ChapterState
participant DayOneState
participant "Voice and props" as Props
Player -> ChapterDirector : Interact at an available objective
ChapterDirector -> ChapterState : Check phase prerequisites and range
ChapterDirector -> ChapterDirector : Capture input weapon cursor and camera ownership
ChapterDirector -> DayOneState : Apply the legal activity action
DayOneState --> ChapterDirector : Return progress or rejection cause
ChapterDirector -> Props : Update physical state and dialogue
ChapterDirector -> ChapterState : Complete only after the final condition
ChapterDirector -> ChapterDirector : Checkpoint and restore control
ChapterDirector --> Player : Show the next actionable objective
@enduml
